OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785750495
OL,3,CPrime Minister hails Bev Craig 'Queen
OL,4,Cof the North' as she becomes Mayor
OL,6,FAndy Burnham told his successor as
OL,7,FGreater Manchester mayor to "go
OL,8,Ffurther and do more" as he dubbed her
OL,9,Fthe "queen of the north" after her by-
OL,10,Felection win.
OL,12,FLabour candidate Bev Craig won the
OL,13,Flargest by-election in British history
OL,14,Fto succeed Mr Burnham in the job after
OL,15,Fhe quit and became Prime Minister.
OL,17,FThe result was announced late on
OL,18,FFriday night, more than 24 hours after
OL,19,Fpolling stations closed, in a
OL,20,Fcomfortable win, although with a low
OL,21,Fturnout.
OL,26,@oD@]OUpD@TO]qD@EOUqD@XO]
