OL,3,CPrime Minister hails Bev Craig 'Queen
OL,4,Cof the North' as she becomes Mayor
OL,6,FSpeaking at a victory event in
OL,7,FManchester alongside Ms Craig, Mr
OL,8,FBurnham touted his plans to further
OL,9,Fdevolve power out of Westminster.
OL,11,F"So, here's my challenge to you today.
OL,12,FOn the back of that, I'm afraid you're
OL,13,Fjust going to have to go further and
OL,14,Fdo more," he said.
OL,26,@sD@AOUvD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
