PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785750495
OL,3,CPrime Minister hails Bev Craig 'Queen
OL,4,Cof the North' as she becomes Mayor
OL,6,FHe challenged her to build on growth
OL,7,Fin the region during his time as
OL,8,Fmayor, build more affordable homes and
OL,9,Fboost technical education for young
OL,10,Fpeople, including by building on
OL,11,Finitiatives such as the Greater
OL,12,FManchester Baccalaureate (MBacc).
OL,14,F"You are the right person to lead this
OL,15,Fgreat city region forward into its
OL,16,Fbest decade ever, because that is what
OL,17,Fthe next decade is going to be.
OL,26,@vD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785750495
OL,3,CPrime Minister hails Bev Craig 'Queen
OL,4,Cof the North' as she becomes Mayor
OL,6,F"So, ladies and gentlemen, without any
OL,7,Ffurther ado, can you give it up for
OL,8,Fthe queen of the north, the new Mayor
OL,9,Fof Greater Manchester, Bev Craig."
OL,11,FMs Craig said people have been "crying
OL,12,Fout" for a commitment from "people in
OL,13,Fpower that get it".
OL,15,F"(People) that want to put more money
OL,16,Fin their pockets. That want to make
OL,17,Flife easier, that are on their side,
OL,18,Fand I'm excited to get stuck in," she
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@bO]sD@`OUtD@DO]tD@\OUuD@RO]wD@
OL,26,AAOUzD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
