CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785750495
OL,3,CPrime Minister hails Bev Craig 'Queen
OL,4,Cof the North' as she becomes Mayor
OL,6,FShe added: "I'll also say one final
OL,7,Fthing, and that's about what people
OL,8,Fhave voted for in this election.
OL,10,F"They voted for Greater Manchester to
OL,11,Fbuild on the legacy that we've created
OL,12,Ftogether, but they voted to reject the
OL,13,Fdivision and the dividing lines that
OL,14,Fpeople put in our communities."
OL,26,@nD@LOUrD@AOUvD@_O]
