FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785750495
OL,3,CPrime Minister hails Bev Craig 'Queen
OL,4,Cof the North' as she becomes Mayor
OL,6,FMr Burnham was blocked from standing
OL,7,Fin the Gorton and Denton by-election
OL,8,Fin February in part because Labour's
OL,9,Fruling national executive committee
OL,10,Fdid not want to put the party's
OL,11,Fcontrol of Greater Manchester at any
OL,12,Frisk.
OL,14,FThe May elections which triggered the
OL,15,Fdeparture of Sir Keir Starmer as prime
OL,16,Fminister saw some big losses in
OL,17,FGreater Manchester, including in
OL,18,FTameside, where Labour lost its
OL,19,Fcouncil majority after an
OL,20,Funinterrupted run of 47 years in
OL,21,Fcharge.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
