FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785750495
OL,3,CPrime Minister hails Bev Craig 'Queen
OL,4,Cof the North' as she becomes Mayor
OL,6,FAnalysis of the full votes showed that
OL,7,FMs Craig topped the poll in the first
OL,8,Fround of voting in all the 10 local
OL,9,Fauthority areas that make up Greater
OL,10,FManchester.
OL,12,FMs Astley came second in eight of the
OL,13,F10 areas while Green candidate
OL,14,FGeraldine Coggins came second in
OL,15,FManchester and the Conservative
OL,16,Fcandidate Phil Eckersley was second in
OL,17,FTrafford.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
